Z||000020||BN Boomer||04-25-2000||11:03 PM||||I don't get it. I must be missing something here. Someone who calls himself "Sleeper" doesn't like cars that live up to the name. Is that not what sleepers are all about, <B>NOT</B> advertising to everyone and his sister what you've got? Personally, I like the idea of really surprisisng the hell out someone at a stoplight. If they're going to bawl and stomp and scream "No fair, no fair, no fair" about not having fair warning about what you've got under the hood after soundly whuppin' them, then the sweeter the victory as far as I'm concerned. Isn't that part of the reason most of us want more power in the first place? To put some idiot snickering at our beloved Fieros in his place?  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"> Personally, that's kind of why I like the Fiero in the first place, not many people expect much from them so they make a perfect sleeper.<P>Would you feel any better if everybody who had a NOS system had a sticker in their back window saying so?<P>I would also think it was funny as hell to see a sleeper Geo Metro. Hell, I'd probably buy the guy a burger or something while checking out his car. Ain't that what this stuff is all about?||||reg||5
