Z||000026||Shaun41178||04-26-2000||12:37 AM||||Nice kill Cutter!!!  Keep them coming.<P>Yes the old nitrous debate, is it cheating or not is back again.  It seems to me that Sleeper seems to be the only one posting on this thread that it is cheating.  Everyone else seems to think that if you have nitrous then more power to you and some even want it for their Fieros.<P>I kind of like the rumor that nitrous is bad for your engine and will blow it up almost immediately.  This keeps the uninformed(read uneducated) from using it on their cars.  The less cars that have nitrous on them the better it is for me as my odds of winning increase.<P>Thats all I am going to say on this topic as Sleeper is set in his ways and I see no reason to try and convince him of thinking any differently.<P>Oh yea sleeper, It seems your car is pretty stock from what you say.  So I am going to guess that you have a high 15 second Fiero at best in the qtr.  Not too competitive really as that is what stock Escorts are running now.  If you pull up next to a civic or any import at a light and he says he has nitrous and you race him anyway,  you can say to YOURSELF that he cheated, but remember, YOU were the one that was just made to look like a fool.<P>Believe what you want.||||reg||10
