Z||000028||Bens88GT||04-26-2000||01:07 AM||||Hey, I just wanted to mention that Cutter raced an Integra with VTEC, NOT V-Tech. V-Tech is a cordless phone manufacturer. My other car is a '99 Integra GS-R, that's the one with VTEC. I have it built all-motor right now putting out 200HP from a 1.8L 4-cylinder. I'd love to put that engine in my Fiero.<P>It'll kick my 88GT's ass in a race under any conditions. But my Fiero is more fun to drive. Don't knock "ricers", there is plenty to appreciate about those cars. You should appreciate them for the engineering marvels that they are, but feel good that your Fiero has more character and is more fun to drive.||||reg||11
